[[Image:Schlammspringer Periophthalmus sp.jpg|thumb|A '''mudskipper''' out of the water]]
===Etymology===
{{compound|en|mud|skipper}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of various [[goby|gobies]] of the subfamily {{taxlink|Oxudercinae|subfamily|noshow=1}} that are able to survive out of water by breathing through their skins and having strong [[pectoral fin]]s that act as simple legs.

